---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/IssaLayout.astro";
import "../../styles/shop.css";
---

<SiteLayout title="Gyokuro | Issa Green" description="Gyokuro | Issa Green">
<section class="pdp">
    <div class="section-wrap">
      <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><a href="/shop-tea">Tea</a><span>›</span><span aria-current="page">Gyokuro</span></nav>
      <div class="pdp-grid">
        <div class="pdp-gallery">
          <div class="pdp-main"><img id="pdp-main" src="/images/shop/gyokuro-30g.jpg" alt="Gyokuro"></div>
          <div class="pdp-thumbs" id="pdp-thumbs"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pdp-info">
          <div class="pdp-ribbons"><span class="pdp-ribbon">Limited</span></div>
          <h1>Gyokuro</h1>
          <p class="pdp-sub">Sencha · Ishikawa farm · Toyota, Aichi</p>
          <div class="pdp-price" id="pdp-price" aria-live="polite"></div>
          <div class="pdp-opt" id="pdp-opt"></div>
          <div class="pdp-buy">
            <div class="qty" role="group" aria-label="Quantity"><button type="button" id="q-dec" aria-label="Decrease quantity">−</button><output id="q-out" aria-live="polite">1</output><button type="button" id="q-inc" aria-label="Increase quantity">+</button></div>
            <button class="pdp-add" id="pdp-add" type="button"></button>
          </div>
          <p class="pdp-msg" id="pdp-msg" role="alert" hidden></p>
          <p class="pdp-note">Shipping and taxes calculated at checkout. <a href="/shipping">Shipping &amp; returns</a></p>
          <p class="pdp-lead">Known as Jade Dew — made with the same tea leaves as matcha, shaded and protected from sunlight. Superior hand-plucked tea with more umami and natural sweetness.</p>
          <div class="pdp-tags"><span class="pdp-tag t0">Health &amp; Beauty</span><span class="pdp-tag t1">Energy boost</span><span class="pdp-tag t2">Rich umami</span></div>
          <div class="acc-list"><div class="acc"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc0">About this tea<span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc-panel" id="acc0" role="region"><div class="acc-in"><p>We have only a limited amount every season. Contains more caffeine compared to regular sencha.</p></div></div></div><div class="acc"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc1">How to brew<span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc-panel" id="acc1" role="region"><div class="acc-in"><p>2 tbsp / 80–100 ml. Cold brew: 0.5–1 hour. We recommend filtered water or bottled soft water, and brewing at proper temperature for this delicate tea.</p></div></div></div><div class="acc"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc2">Product details<span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc-panel" id="acc2" role="region"><div class="acc-in"><p><strong>Ingredients</strong> Organic green tea</p><p><strong>Available</strong> Loose tea 30g</p></div></div></div><div class="acc"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc3">Shipping info<span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc-panel" id="acc3" role="region"><div class="acc-in"><p><strong>Calgary</strong> Within Calgary city limit: $7 flat rate. Free delivery over $75.</p><p><strong>Rest of Canada</strong> $12 flat rate shipping by Canada Post or courier service. Free shipping over $150.</p><p>If you prefer another shipping method, please do not hesitate to contact us. We will arrange a special shipment.</p></div></div></div><div class="acc"><button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="acc4">Return &amp; refund policy<span aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="acc-panel" id="acc4" role="region"><div class="acc-in"><p><strong>Tea</strong> Due to the character of our products, we cannot accept returns or refunds of packaged tea and food.</p><p><strong>Tea ware &amp; goods</strong> We accept returns and issue a gift card for the same amount as the purchased goods. Customers pay the postage for returns.</p><p>Please inform us about defects immediately by email at <a href="mailto:issagreentea@gmail.com">issagreentea@gmail.com</a>. We will make an exchange as soon as possible.</p><p>Most of our products are handcrafted and have unique characters. We are happy to tell you the exact condition of each item before shipping. Please leave the request on the checkout page.</p></div></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="pdp-rel"><div class="section-wrap"><p class="section-label">More tea</p><div class="rel-grid"><a class="rel-card" href="/products/fukamushi-sencha"><span class="rel-img"><img src="/images/shop/fukamushi-sencha-bags.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="rel-name">Fukamushi sencha</span><span class="rel-price">From $22.00</span></a><a class="rel-card" href="/products/premium-sencha"><span class="rel-img"><img src="/images/shop/premium-sencha-80g.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="rel-name">Premium sencha</span><span class="rel-price">$24.50</span></a><a class="rel-card" href="/products/fukamushi-genmaicha"><span class="rel-img"><img src="/images/shop/fukamushi-genmaicha-80g.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="rel-name">Fukamushi Genmaicha</span><span class="rel-price">From $19.80</span></a><a class="rel-card" href="/products/ceremonial-matcha"><span class="rel-img"><img src="/images/shop/ceremonial-matcha-30g.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="rel-name">Ceremonial Matcha 30g</span><span class="rel-price">$25.00</span></a></div>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:36px"><a class="btn-explore" href="/shop-tea">All tea</a></p></div></section>
  
  
<script is:inline>window.PDP = {"name": "Gyokuro", "optname": null, "variants": [{"id": "gyokuro-loose-tea-30g", "label": "Loose tea 30g", "price": null, "was": null, "soldout": true, "img": "/images/shop/gyokuro-30g.jpg", "imgs": ["/images/shop/gyokuro-30g.jpg", "/images/shop/gyokuro-30g-hover.jpg"], "name": "Gyokuro", "variant": "Loose tea 30g"}]};</script>
<script is:inline src="/pdp.js"></script>
</SiteLayout>
